          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.2 What Happens When Acidic Substances Mix with Basic Substances?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.498,
            0.7,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us investigate by performing the following "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "experiment",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.531,
            0.442,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 2.7: Let us experiment",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.565,
            0.633,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take one drop of lemon juice in a test tube and add around twenty drops of water to it. Observe the colour."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.626,
            0.541,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Add a drop of blue litmus solution to it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.65,
            0.616,
            0.672
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you observe any colour change (Fig. 2.10a)?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.674,
            0.631,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Slowly add drops of lime water to this test tube with the help of a dropper and swirl it well."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.717,
            0.631,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do you observe? Is there any change in the colour of the solution?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.65,
            0.637,
            0.894,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fig. 2.10(a): The colour of the solution on adding blue litmus solution"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.76,
            0.631,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A stage comes when the colour of the solution changes from red to blue (Fig. 2.10b)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.802,
            0.631,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Again, add one drop of lemon juice to the above solution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.723,
            0.491,
